      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rejoice not, O Israel, for joy, as",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "other",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "people: for thou hast gone a whoring from thy God, thou hast loved a reward upon every cornfloor.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The floor and the winepress shall not feed them, and the new wine shall fail in her.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall not dwell in the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD's",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "land; but Ephraim shall return to Egypt, and they shall eat unclean",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in Assyria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall not offer wine",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "offerings",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", neither shall they be pleasing unto him: their sacrifices",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto them as the bread of mourners; all that eat thereof shall be polluted: for their bread for their soul shall not come into the house of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What will ye do in the solemn day, and in the day of the feast of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For, lo, they are gone because of destruction: Egypt shall gather them up, Memphis shall bury them: the pleasant",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "places",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for their silver, nettles shall possess them: thorns",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in their tabernacles.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The days of visitation are come, the days of recompence are come; Israel shall know",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the prophet",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a fool, the spiritual man",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mad, for the multitude of thine iniquity, and the great hatred.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The watchman of Ephraim",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with my God:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the prophet",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a snare of a fowler in all his ways,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hatred in the house of his God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They have deeply corrupted",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "themselves",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", as in the days of Gibeah:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "therefore",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he will remember their iniquity, he will visit their sins.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I found Israel like grapes in the wilderness; I saw your fathers as the firstripe in the fig tree at her first time:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they went to Baal-peor, and separated themselves unto",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shame; and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "their",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abominations were according as they loved.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "As for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ephraim, their glory shall fly away like a bird, from the birth, and from the womb, and from the conception.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Though they bring up their children, yet will I bereave them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that there shall",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.9.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.9.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
